# logs/.gitkeep
# =============
# This file exists solely to make Git track the logs/ directory.
#
# Purpose of logs/:
#   The AI module writes structured log output to this directory
#   when LOG_FILE is set in .env (default: ./logs/ai_module.log).
#
#   Log file rotation is handled by the OS or a log management tool.
#   Do not commit log files to version control.
#
# .gitignore rules for this directory:
#   logs/*.log               (never commit log files)
#   !logs/.gitkeep           (always keep this placeholder)
#
# Log format (configured in config.py):
#   2026-04-20 09:15:30 | INFO     | slt_ai.forecasting | Prophet trained
#   2026-04-20 09:15:31 | WARNING  | slt_ai.extractor   | DB unavailable
